  "ruleText": "Ins 4701.09 Claim Settlement. Blanket and group accident and health travel insurance claims shall be subject to Ins 1001 on claim settlements.\n\nSource. #10681, eff 11-3-14; ss by #13989, eff 5-29-24 (formerly Ins 4701.10)",
